<title>UK: Energis too big for one partner - Nat.Grid.</title>
<headline>Energis too big for one partner - Nat.Grid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electricity transmission network National Grid Group Plc considers its telecommunications unit Energis to be too big for a single partnership deal, finance director John Uttley told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Whereas 18 months, two years ago, looking for a single big partner seemed to be the right way to go, we now think it's unlikely that will be the way ahead,&quot; Uttley said in a telephone interview.</p>
</text>
